SUMMARY:John Mulaney: Mister Whatever LIVE at Ovens Auditorium
DTSTAMP:20260808T093526Z
DTSTART:20260808T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJohn Mula
	ney is one of the most acclaimed comedians of his generation — a four-time
	 Emmy Award winner\, Critics’ Choice Award winner\, and WGA Award-winning 
	writer whose stand-up specials have become cultural touchstones. Known for
	 his impeccable timing\, literary wit\, and deeply personal storytelling\,
	 Mulaney has earned a devoted following that spans every demographic. \nHi
	s 2026 Mister Whatever tour marks a triumphant return to the stage with al
	l-new material. Fans and critics alike have praised the show as some of Mu
	laney’s sharpest and most personal work yet — a reflection on life\, chang
	e\, and the absurdity of being human. The tour has already sold out major 
	venues across North America\, including a historic stand-up performance at
	 Wrigley Field. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Mulaney for
	 the first time\, this is a rare opportunity to see one of comedy’s true g
	reats perform in an intimate theater setting. Don’t miss it. \nEvent Detai
	ls\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM EDT\nShow Time
	: 7:00 PM EDT\nVenue: Ovens Auditorium\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, C
	harlotte\, NC 28205\nTicket Price Range: $117 – $808+\nContent Warning: Ad
	ult language and mature themes\n\nAbout the Venue\nOvens Auditorium is one
	 of Charlotte’s most storied and beloved performance venues\, located at 2
	900 E Independence Boulevard. With a seating capacity of approximately 2\,
	600 guests\, it offers an intimate yet grand theater experience that is pe
	rfectly suited for a comedian of Mulaney’s caliber. \nThe venue features O
	rchestra\, Mezzanine\, and Balcony seating sections\, all with excellent s
	ightlines to the stage. Ovens Auditorium is known for its warm acoustics\,
	 classic architecture\, and the kind of close-to-the-performer atmosphere 
	that makes every show feel special. It is managed by Blumenthal Performing
	 Arts and has hosted some of the biggest names in entertainment. \nParking
	 is available on-site and in nearby lots along E Independence Boulevard. T
	he venue is easily accessible by car from both Uptown Charlotte and the su
	rrounding suburbs. Arrive early to enjoy the pre-show atmosphere and find 
	your seats comfortably before showtime. \nWhat to Expect\nJohn Mulaney’s M
	ister Whatever is a solo stand-up performance featuring entirely new mater
	ial. Mulaney is celebrated for his ability to craft long-form comedic narr
	atives that feel like short stories — each one building to a perfectly tim
	ed punchline that lands with the force of a freight train. \nExpect an eve
	ning of sophisticated\, laugh-out-loud comedy that touches on life’s big m
	oments and small absurdities alike. Mulaney’s stage presence is magnetic\,
	 his delivery is flawless\, and his material is the kind that sticks with 
	you long after the show ends. \nThis is a solo headlining show with no ope
	ning act listed. The show is expected to run approximately 90 minutes. Sea
	ting is reserved — arrive on time to settle in before the lights go down. 
	\nTicket Information\nTickets range from $117 to $808+ depending on sectio
	n and availability. Purchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaste
	r\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Ti
	ckets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no
	 extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/john-mulaney-miste
	r-whatever-live-at-ovens-auditorium/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/john-mulaney-mister-whatever-live-at-o
	vens-auditorium/
LOCATION:Ovens Auditorium\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, Charlotte\, NC\
	, 28205\, United States
