SUMMARY:Bob the Drag Queen LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260808T093526Z
DTSTART:20260808T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nBob the 
	Drag Queen — born Caldwell Tidicue — is one of the most electrifying and m
	ultifaceted entertainers in comedy today. Best known for winning the title
	 of “America’s Next Drag Superstar” on Season 8 of RuPaul’s Drag Race\, Bo
	b has since built an empire that spans stand-up comedy\, television\, podc
	asting\, and literature. \nBob’s comedy is sharp\, unapologetic\, and deep
	ly personal — blending razor-sharp wit with social commentary\, personal s
	torytelling\, and outrageous crowd work. Audiences can expect a high-energ
	y performance that is as hilarious as it is thought-provoking. \nBeyond dr
	ag\, Bob has hosted three seasons of HBO’s Peabody Award-winning series We
	’re Here\, competed as a fan-favorite on Peacock’s The Traitors\, and host
	ed Madonna’s iconic Celebration World Tour in 2023–2024. Bob’s debut book\
	, Harriet Tubman: Live in Concert\, became a New York Times Bestseller in 
	May 2025. Bob’s podcast Sibling Rivalry\, co-hosted with drag sister Monét
	 X Change\, is one of America’s top comedy podcasts. \nEvent Details\n\nDa
	te: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nShow Time: 9:30 PM CDT (Doors open at 9:00
	 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, 
	TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ (Valid photo ID required for entry)\nFood &
	 Beverage: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe L
	augh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destina
	tion\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — j
	ust inside the loop and only a few miles from San Antonio International Ai
	rport. \nThe club features an intimate showroom with a warm\, club-style a
	tmosphere perfect for comedy. Seating is first-come\, first-served by sect
	ion\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best spots. The venue
	 offers both Preferred Seating (center stage) and General Admission tables
	 (side stage and wings). \nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club also features a 
	full bar lounge — a great place to grab a drink before the show. The venue
	 is ideal for date nights\, group outings\, birthday parties\, and special
	 events. Note: there is an 18% service charge on all checks in the showroo
	m\, and food and beverage service ends approximately 45 minutes into the s
	how. \nWhat to Expect\nBob the Drag Queen delivers a full stand-up comedy 
	experience that is unlike anything else on the touring circuit. Expect a h
	igh-energy\, laugh-out-loud performance filled with personal stories\, sha
	rp social commentary\, and Bob’s signature brand of fearless\, unapologeti
	c humor. \nThis is a late-night show (9:30 PM)\, so expect an energetic cr
	owd and a performer at the top of their game. Bob has headlined multiple t
	heater-level stand-up comedy tours and brings that same big-stage energy t
	o the intimate setting of the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club. \nWhether you’re
	 a longtime fan of RuPaul’s Drag Race or simply love great stand-up comedy
	\, this show promises to be a memorable night out in San Antonio. \nTicket
	 Information\nPrice Range: $37.58 – $49.94 (includes fees) \n\nPreferred I
	ndividual Ticket: $40 + fees = $49.94\nGA Individual Ticket: $30 + fees = 
	$37.58\n\nTickets are available through official Ticketmaster/TicketWeb ch
	annels and resale platforms. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges
	. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links
	. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no ext
	ra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid
	 photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/b
	ob-the-drag-queen-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calen
	dar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bob-the-drag-queen-live-at-laugh-out-l
	oud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\
	, TX\, 78216\, USA
