SUMMARY:Daniel Sloss: BITTER LIVE at The Wilbur (Matinee)
DTSTAMP:20260808T093526Z
DTSTART:20260809T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nDaniel Sl
	oss is one of Scotland’s most celebrated stand-up comedians\, known for hi
	s razor-sharp wit\, dark humor\, and deeply personal storytelling. He firs
	t gained international attention with his Netflix specials Dark and Jigsaw
	\, the latter of which became famous for reportedly causing thousands of b
	reakups worldwide after audiences reconsidered their relationships. \nNow 
	Sloss is back with his brand-new tour\, BITTER — a show that dives headfir
	st into love\, loss\, and the messy aftermath of both. Expect the same unf
	linching honesty and comedic brilliance that has made him one of the most 
	talked-about comedians of his generation. His style blends laugh-out-loud 
	moments with genuine emotional depth\, leaving audiences both in stitches 
	and in their feelings. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\n
	Time: 3:00 PM (Matinee Show)\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\
	, MA 02116\nDoors Open: Approximately 2:00 PM\nAge Restriction: 18+ recomm
	ended (adult content)\nTicket Prices: From $68 (avg. ~$147)\n\nAbout the V
	enue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most iconic and beloved comedy venues\
	, located in the heart of the Theatre District at 246 Tremont Street. Buil
	t in 1914\, this stunning 1\,200-seat theater combines historic elegance w
	ith modern amenities\, offering an intimate yet grand atmosphere perfect f
	or stand-up comedy. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from every s
	eat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, energetic atmosphere that makes every show
	 feel special. Whether you’re in the orchestra\, mezzanine\, or balcony\, 
	you’ll feel close to the action. Parking is available at nearby garages\, 
	and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange Lines (Bo
	ylston and Back Bay stations). \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a rare Sunday mat
	inee performance of Daniel Sloss’s BITTER tour — a perfect afternoon outin
	g for comedy fans who want to experience one of the world’s best stand-up 
	comedians in an intimate Boston setting. The show runs approximately 90 mi
	nutes with no intermission. \nSloss performs solo\, commanding the stage w
	ith his signature blend of dark comedy and personal narrative. Fans of his
	 Netflix specials will find BITTER to be his most mature and emotionally r
	esonant work yet. Come prepared to laugh hard\, think deeply\, and leave w
	ith a new perspective on relationships and life. \nTicket Information\nTic
	ket Prices: From $68 (average ~$147) \nSecure your seats through official 
	Ticketmaster channels or find resale tickets through VividSeats: \nOfficia
	l TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn 
	a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/
	daniel-sloss-bitter-live-at-the-wilbur-matinee/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/daniel-sloss-bitter-live-at-the-wilbur
	-matinee/
