SUMMARY:Charleston White LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa
DTSTAMP:20260808T093526Z
DTSTART:20260809T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nCharleston White LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club 
	Tulsa\nOne of comedy’s most provocative and fearless voices\, Charleston W
	hite\, is bringing his electrifying stand-up show to Bricktown Comedy Club
	 Tulsa. Known for his raw honesty\, street-smart humor\, and unapologetic 
	storytelling\, Charleston White delivers a comedy experience unlike any ot
	her. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM (Doors
	 open 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 5982 S Yale A
	ve\, Tulsa\, OK 74135\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Prices: $97 – $17
	6 (General Admission & Premium) \nAbout Charleston White\nCharleston White
	 is a comedian\, activist\, and social media personality who has built a m
	assive following with his unfiltered takes on life\, culture\, and society
	. Rising from humble beginnings in Fort Worth\, Texas\, White has channele
	d his life experiences into a powerful comedic voice that resonates with a
	udiences across the country. His viral videos and live performances have e
	arned him millions of fans who appreciate his bold\, no-nonsense approach 
	to comedy and social commentary. \nWhat to Expect\n\nBold\, unfiltered sta
	nd-up comedy with real talk and real laughs\nPowerful storytelling rooted 
